  "description": "TUnit-native fluent log-assertion DSL using [AssertionExtension] over Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Testing.FakeLogCollector. Provides Assert.That(collector).HasLogged()/HasNotLogged()/HasLoggedSequence()/HasLoggedOnly() with filter and terminator chaining, the event-driven WillLog() wait for background work, a live tee of each record into the test report, and a dump of the captured records when a test does not pass; emits a captured-records snapshot in failure messages.",
  "id": "LogAssertions.TUnit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
